---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---
<section class="relative bg-[#f9f9f9]">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-24 lg:py-[72px]">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="mt-0 text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight text-balance ">Top Topics</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 mt-10 -mx-4 gap-y-10 sm:mx-auto lg:max-w-none md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-14 lg:-mx-8">
      <div   class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-[0.060rem] border border-gray-200">
        <div class="h-full p-6 bg-white rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
          
            <div class="mt-6 text-indigo-400">
              <img class="" alt="Retain users with gift card software" loading="lazy" width="350" src="/assets/about-us/AI.webp">
            </div>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-center lg:py-2">
              AI-driven Personalized Campaigns
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-center">How AI-powered solutions - including those from 99minds - are going to completely change the personalization game for retail marketing campaigns in 2026.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div   class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-[0.060rem] border border-gray-200">
          <div class="h-full p-6 bg-white rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
          
            <div class="mt-6 text-indigo-400">
              <img class="" alt="Retain users with gift card software" loading="lazy" width="350" src="/assets/about-us/Customer Retention.webp">
            </div>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-center  lg:py-2">
              Customer Retention and Loyalty in 2026
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-center">The impact of ever-changing trends, fast fashion, AI, and other disruptors on customer retention in 2026, and how 99minds is building the futuristic solutions for those challenges.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div   class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-[0.060rem] border border-gray-200">
        <div class="h-full p-6 bg-white rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
          
            <div class="mt-6 text-indigo-400">
              <img class="" alt="Retain users with gift card software" loading="lazy" width="350" src="/assets/about-us/order-process.webp">
            </div>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-center  lg:py-2">
              Retail Marketing and Its Challenges in 2026
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-center">The new challenges facing every retail merchant in 2026, and how they plan to cope with them (along with what 99minds can do to help). </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



